{"1374960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SpaceVenture", "steam_appid": 1374960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4280740], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST Off into SPACEVENTURE! </strong>Become Ace Hardway, a &quot;Life Support Systems technician&quot; (let’s be honest—a space plumber), and his robotic dog, Rooter, on an epic intergalactic misadventure. When a routine repair job spirals into galaxy-spanning chaos, Ace finds himself battling sewer monsters, evading crooked cops, and uncovering a sinister conspiracy involving mind-controlling video game consoles. Along the way, you'll build a new spaceship, tinker with bizarre tech, and navigate quirky worlds filled with alien oddballs, unstable AIs, and absurd puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by the minds behind the beloved <i>Space Quest</i> series, <i>SpaceVenture</i> combines sharp humor, challenging puzzles, and nostalgic charm in a modern point-and-click adventure. Featuring stellar voice acting, a retro-inspired score, and endless nods to sci-fi classics, this crowdfunded game delivers a hilarious and heartwarming romp through the stars. Will Ace and Rooter save the galaxy or just make a cosmic mess? Only one way to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your  ship</strong> – Scavenge for parts, refuel with questionable bio-waste, and piece together your interstellar junker as you forge your path across the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a galaxy of interesting locales</strong> – From junk asteroids and sketchy space stations to alien deserts and the Hyperspace Beltway, every stop is packed with puzzles, and that trademark Two Guys from Andromeda humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with unforgettable characters</strong> – Encounter crooked cops, eccentric inventors, shady CEOs, and a robotic dog with a nose for trouble. Everyone has a story... and some of them want you gone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve challenging puzzles with a comedic twist</strong> – Use your wits, tools, and trusty PDA apps to fix leaks, outsmart enemies, and uncover hidden truths about a galaxy-sized conspiracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLAST Off into SPACEVENTURE! </strong>Become Ace Hardway, a &quot;Life Support Systems technician&quot; (let’s be honest—a space plumber), and his robotic dog, Rooter, on an epic intergalactic misadventure. When a routine repair job spirals into galaxy-spanning chaos, Ace finds himself battling sewer monsters, evading crooked cops, and uncovering a sinister conspiracy involving mind-controlling video game consoles. Along the way, you'll build a new spaceship, tinker with bizarre tech, and navigate quirky worlds filled with alien oddballs, unstable AIs, and absurd puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by the minds behind the beloved <i>Space Quest</i> series, <i>SpaceVenture</i> combines sharp humor, challenging puzzles, and nostalgic charm in a modern point-and-click adventure. Featuring stellar voice acting, a retro-inspired score, and endless nods to sci-fi classics, this crowdfunded game delivers a hilarious and heartwarming romp through the stars. Will Ace and Rooter save the galaxy or just make a cosmic mess? Only one way to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your  ship</strong> – Scavenge for parts, refuel with questionable bio-waste, and piece together your interstellar junker as you forge your path across the stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a galaxy of interesting locales</strong> – From junk asteroids and sketchy space stations to alien deserts and the Hyperspace Beltway, every stop is packed with puzzles, and that trademark Two Guys from Andromeda humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interact with unforgettable characters</strong> – Encounter crooked cops, eccentric inventors, shady CEOs, and a robotic dog with a nose for trouble. Everyone has a story... and some of them want you gone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve challenging puzzles with a comedic twist</strong> – Use your wits, tools, and trusty PDA apps to fix leaks, outsmart enemies, and uncover hidden truths about a galaxy-sized conspiracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A sci-fi comedy adventure game", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374960/header.jpg?t=1766536015", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374960/a76ee8a5b65a64038ee166f8962b11a328367681/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766536015", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1374960/a76ee8a5b65a64038ee166f8962b11a328367681/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766536015", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Recent Intel/AMD Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB+ of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Sound card required for playback of music, SFX, and VO</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Guys from Andromeda"], "publishers": ["Guys from Andromeda"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1499, "final": 1499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_for